* to v5.0.0, with a SEV2 for it.\n3. **Roll back only `payments-worker`** to v3.3.0, with a SEV2 for it.\n\nBoth targets have been healthy in production before, so no change-manager approval is needed. I can do any of these as soon as you confirm.", "context": {}}, {"t_ms": 165927, "event": "human_response", "actor": "human", "escalation": "esc1", "decision": "answer", "message": "It's payments-worker - the API errors are downstream of the worker.", "latency_ms": 133761, "hint": {"service": "payments-worker"}, "erred": false}, {"t_ms": 165927, "event": "principal_reply", "actor": "human", "text": "It's payments-worker - the API errors are downstream of the worker."}, {"t_ms": 169891, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_017Rft2WNBuwYbiwS4xtVUKN", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "payments-worker", "version": "v3.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 173891, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_017Rft2WNBuwYbiwS4xtVUKN", "tool": "rollback", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 173891, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_017Rft2WNBuwYbiwS4xtVUKN", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 173891, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01FWmU7uF9rURk3ZqcTGWNSF", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "payments-worker errors after v3.4.0 deploy; rolled back to v3.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "payments-worker", "summary": "payments-worker v3.4.0 (this morning's deploy) was unhealthy in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) with an 18% error rate. payments-api (v5.1.0, degraded, 18% errors) is failing downstream of the worker. Rolled payments-worker back to v3.3.0, the last release that was healthy in production. Watch payments-api to confirm it recovers.", "idempotency_key": "payments-worker-v3.4.0-rollback-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 174491, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01FWmU7uF9rURk3ZqcTGWNSF", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "payments-worker-v3.4.0-rollback-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 174491, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01FWmU7uF9rURk3ZqcTGWNSF", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 176567, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_017knVoBShvf9noWhzfu5LVK", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "payments-worker"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 176867, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_017knVoBShvf9noWhzfu5LVK", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 176867, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_017knVoBShvf9noWhzfu5LVK", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 176867, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01GXnvDmU3pVCL7adWtBi13H", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "payments-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 177167, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01GXnvDmU3pVCL7adWtBi13H", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 177167, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01GXnvDmU3pVCL7adWtBi13H", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 181830, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled `payments-worker` back to v3.3.0 and opened the SEV2. The worker has recove